{
  "_reasons": {
    ".agents/skills/improve-codebase-architecture/HTML-REPORT.md": "Vendored skill: skills-lock.json:94 pins it to mattpocock/skills, so its prose belongs to that repo and a local respelling is overwritten by the next skill update.",
    ".agents/skills/prototype/UI.md": "Vendored skill: skills-lock.json:118 pins it to mattpocock/skills, so its prose belongs to that repo and a local respelling is overwritten by the next skill update.",
    "AGENTS.md": "Both name the rule this gate enforces, in its Conventions & Patterns entry: the banned spelling itself, and the `colour_levels` key the entry lists as a contract.",
    "crates/er-build-import-core/build.rs": "1 of 3 is a contract: the `\"colour\"` match arm at build.rs:60 is the planner's own layout `type` string, read from data/planner-sliders-layout.json at build.rs:22. The `Colour` variant name (build.rs:60, :66) is ours and deprecable.",
    "crates/er-build-import-core/data/planner-sliders-layout.json": "All 75 are the build planner's: build.rs:3 records this file as the planner's own `q9` table copied from its page, and keys such as `skinColour` and the `type` value are the field names of its share-link documents, which the planner itself parses.",
    "crates/er-build-import-core/src/sliders.rs": "1 of 14 is a contract: `eyeColour` at sliders.rs:648 is a planner share-link key. `FieldKind::Colour` and the prose are ours and deprecable.",
    "crates/er-cel-shade/src/settings.rs": "1 of 4 is a contract: the key `colour_levels` at settings.rs:97 is written into users' er-cel-shade.toml by render_look (settings.rs:407) and parsed back by set_knob (settings.rs:338), so respelling it orphans the line in every existing file. The label and help text (:99, :100, :121) are ours.",
    "scripts/comment-caps-words.txt": "Generated: scripts/gen-comment-caps-words.py writes it from wordfreq's English vocabulary, and the 5 forms there are what let check-comment-caps.py recognise a shouted British spelling as a word rather than a name.",
    "scripts/er-npc-planner-link.py": "1 of 3 is a contract: `skinColour` at er-npc-planner-link.py:535 is a planner share-link key. The prose at :102 and :535 is ours.",
    "scripts/frida/ai-lua/mods/turtles.lua": "1 of 2 is a contract: `accessoriesColour` at turtles.lua:19 names the planner share-link key the faces were edited through. The prose beside it is ours.",
    "scripts/planner-copy-build.py": "4 of 14 are a contract: `accessoriesColour` at planner-copy-build.py:41, :51 and :61 (twice) is the planner share-link key the script writes. The `--accessories-colour` flag and the prose are ours.",
    "scripts/planner-face-hex.py": "3 of 4 are a contract: the layout `type` value at planner-face-hex.py:51 and the `skinColour` key at :83 and :85 come from the planner's layout table. The label at :89 is ours."
  },
